{
  "$comment": "Logos, flags, club crests and faces shown beside names on the page (next to a gauge's leader, a card's contenders and each side of a match). Fetched once by `npm run logos` (Iconify's free sets, ESPN's crests and headshots) and saved in public/logos.js and public/marks/, so the page never calls anyone for them. Names are matched without case or accents; a longer name wins over a shorter one it contains. To add one: put the name here and run `npm run logos`. A name with no entry simply shows no mark.",
